en, Dougs beste Freunde zu sein. Das Chaos ist damit vorprogrammiert ...\",\"primaryImage\":{\"id\":\"d43151b1c1ba6e2d0c280adeb2040daad10890b3\",\"accentColor\":\"#bc449c\",\"darkAccentColor\":\"#70285d\",\"url\":\"https://img.joyn.de/ingest/t_001/i_0i215ohqasy3_6cda6ad6.jpg/profile:nextgen-web-heroportrait-243x365\",\"defaultIconicImageUrl\":\"https://img.joyn.de/ingest/t_001/i_0i215ohqasy3_6cda6ad6.jpg/profile:nextgen-web-primary-503x\"},\"artLogoImage\":{\"id\":\"6386f82a0d5674a9edad54b9c5ede26e51c4e643\",\"accentColor\":\"#bc449c\",\"url\":\"https://img.joyn.de/ingest/t_001/i_wvpytylst69e_37001e4b.png/profile:nextgen-web-artlogo-210x86\"},\"heroPortrait\":{\"id\":\"b13f68a826e8d95fc397888e029d31c51490a997\",\"url\":\"https://img.joyn.de/ingest/t_001/i_bnn1mp8dq2mz_78240e9e.jpg/profile:nextgen-web-heroportrait-243x365\"},\"genres\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\",\"type\":\"COMEDY\",\"__typename\":\"Genre\"},{\"name\":\"Romanze\",\"type\":\"ROMANCE\",\"__typename\":\"Genre\"}],\"brands\":[{\"id\":\"101\",\"title\":\"PULS 4\",\"logo\":{\"type\":\"BRAND_LOGO\",\"url\":\"https://img.joyn.de/cms/var/assets/Content/Shared/Brand/CMS/AVOD/PULS%2B4/PULS4_logo_1.png/profile:nextgen-web-brand-50x\"}}],\"path\":\"/filme/die-trauzeugen-ag\",\"licenseTypes\":[\"AVOD\"],\"markings\":[],\"languages\":[],\"ageRating\":{\"minAge\":12},\"iconicImage\":null},{\"id\":\"b_pi1jgd6blui\",\"title\":\"John Wick\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"description\":\"Gangster Iosef Tarasov bricht in das Haus von John Wick ein, tötet seinen Hund und klaut sein Auto. Doch er ahnt nicht, dass er damit die Wut eines berüchtigten Killers geweckt hat.\",\"primaryImage\":{\"id\":\"c21a92be9d8d63effed0b6ee1b0285aa1eecc36a\",\"accentColor\":\"#ac7052\",\"darkAccentColor\":\"#674331\",\"url\":\"https://img.joyn.de/ingest/t_001/i_0aii7rtr9x0i.jpg/profile:nextgen-web-heroportrait-243x365\",\"defaultIconicImageUrl\":\"https://img.joyn.de/ingest/t_001/i_0aii7rtr9x0i.jpg/profile:nextgen-web-primary-503x\"},\"artLogoImage\":